      "message": "So there are extensions that will allow us to also do the advanced blend modes using fixed function hardware.\n\nCould we not rewrite these two nested ifs as:\n\n```\nif (fDstReadReq !\u003d DstReadRequirement::kNone) {\n    SkBlendModeBlender blender(*finalBlendMode);\n    AddDstBlendBlock(keyContext, builder, gatherer, \u0026blender);\n    finalBlendMode \u003d SkBlendMode::kSrc;\nelse {\n    // TODO: once we support advanced blend extensions we can remove this assert\n    // but for now we should only get here if we have a normal porter-duff blend\n    // mode (i.e. a CoeffMode in SkBlendMode enum)\n    SkASSERT(*finalBlendMode \u003c\u003d kLastCoeffMode);\n    \u003cdo what\u0027s needed for fixed function blend mode\u003e\n}",
