      "side": 1,
      "message": "So to try to fully spell things out for myself, we need to somehow account for three separate cases:\n1) a custom blender, that is, not a blend-mode blender\n2) a blend-mode blender that we must implement in a shader\n3) a blend-mode blender that we can do with HW\n\nAn assumption of this CL is that we already check for cases 1 and 2 when determining our dst read requirement. So actually, consistent with your comments, we should be able to just check the dst read requirement to decide whether to use HW blending (if we\u0027re ok with this assumption).",
