      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is a very clear comment. If I\u0027m reading it correctly it seems to suggest the reason we\u0027re doing in shader blending is purely because we have coverage. Well technically the advanced blend modes are also SkBlendModes (e.g. color burn), and without the fixed function extensions for them they will always require in shader blending. I think leaving the comment simply as something like:\n```\nWe cannot handle the combination of blend mode and coverage using the fixed function blend hardware. Thus we manually do all the blending in the shader and set the fixed blend mode to be kSrc.\n```",
